00:58:37.650 --> 00:58:45.830
<v Ira Glass>WBEZ management oversight by Torey Malatia. In the crowded gym locker room, I can report to you, he just repeats this mantra over and over--

00:58:45.830 --> 00:58:48.100
<v Colin Dunn>"Can't throw in the towel. Can't throw in the towel."

00:58:48.100 --> 00:58:55.490
<v Ira Glass>I'm Ira Glass. Back next week with more stories of This American Life.

00:58:55.490 --> 00:59:00.490
